cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its design record, please cite it."
title: "Bankspeak, Continued — analysis code and frozen design record"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, test suite and complete frozen design record for an independent
  reconstruction of Moretti and Pestre's Bankspeak (2015) from primary World Bank
  documents, extended to fiscal 2024, together with a two-stage preregistered
  test of whether post-2022 LLM-associated vocabulary shows a World Bank
  discontinuity relative to an IMF Article IV comparator. The confirmatory result
  is negative: no panel satisfies the preregistered decision rule. The corpus
  itself is not included; the IMF material is held under a permission forbidding
  redistribution and is represented by SHA-256 hashes in a separate evidence
  deposit.
